    {
      "id": "9vLu1rMZ014yep59zY4II",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 467.7041340977694,
      "y": 21267.724577774046,
      "width": 1089,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2015960516,
      "version": 515,
      "versionNonce": 371394336,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791256962112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It is an AI model, that is properly trained by some company or organization and they left this \nmodel in internet, Now as a use we can download this trained model in our machine, and \n1. Now we can do anything with this, now we dont need to pay anything to use this.\n2. Since it is present in our machine now we can fine tune this also, if we want , we can download \n    deploy this also. so we have full control over it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It is an AI model, that is properly trained by some company or organization and they left this \nmodel in internet, Now as a use we can download this trained model in our machine, and \n1. Now we can do anything with this, now we dont need to pay anything to use this.\n2. Since it is present in our machine now we can fine tune this also, if we want , we can download \n    deploy this also. so we have full control over it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vbZj8YOgcqXJBsJceTNkb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 399.5361653477694,
      "y": 21488.908171524046,
      "width": 968,
      "height": 1550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 415467516,
      "version": 211,
      "versionNonce": 382499552,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791256962112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "git reset --soft HEAD~1 means:\n\"Undo my latest commit, but keep all the changes I made in that commit.\"\nIt does not delete your code/files.\n\nExample\n\nSuppose your history is:\n\nA → B → C\n        ↑\n      HEAD\n\nYou made commit C:\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add LangChain models\"\n\nThen you run:\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\nYour history becomes:\nA → B\n\nCommit C is removed from the branch history.\nBut the changes from C are still there and are staged:\n\nWorking files:\n    ✅ changes still present\n\nStaging area:\n    ✅ changes still staged\n\nGit history:\n    ❌ commit C removed\n\nYou can verify with:\n\n\ngit status\n\n\nWhy this helps in your case\nGitHub found the API key in commit: 603a90788a3023dbd0e0f8d2aca236381caaafc6\n\nIf that commit is your latest commit, you can do:\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\nThen remove the API key from the Excalidraw file.\nAfter that:\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add LangChain models\"\ngit push\n\nNow the new commit won't contain the secret.\nOne important distinction\n\nThere are three common reset modes:\n\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1 ➡️ Remove commit, keep changes staged\ngit reset --mixed HEAD~1  ➡️ Remove commit, keep changes but unstaged\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1 ➡️ Remove commit and delete the changes ⚠️\n\nFor your situation, --soft is the safer choice because you don't want to lose your work.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "git reset --soft HEAD~1 means:\n\"Undo my latest commit, but keep all the changes I made in that commit.\"\nIt does not delete your code/files.\n\nExample\n\nSuppose your history is:\n\nA → B → C\n        ↑\n      HEAD\n\nYou made commit C:\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add LangChain models\"\n\nThen you run:\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\nYour history becomes:\nA → B\n\nCommit C is removed from the branch history.\nBut the changes from C are still there and are staged:\n\nWorking files:\n    ✅ changes still present\n\nStaging area:\n    ✅ changes still staged\n\nGit history:\n    ❌ commit C removed\n\nYou can verify with:\n\n\ngit status\n\n\nWhy this helps in your case\nGitHub found the API key in commit: 603a90788a3023dbd0e0f8d2aca236381caaafc6\n\nIf that commit is your latest commit, you can do:\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\nThen remove the API key from the Excalidraw file.\nAfter that:\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Add LangChain models\"\ngit push\n\nNow the new commit won't contain the secret.\nOne important distinction\n\nThere are three common reset modes:\n\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1 ➡️ Remove commit, keep changes staged\ngit reset --mixed HEAD~1  ➡️ Remove commit, keep changes but unstaged\ngit reset --hard HEAD~1 ➡️ Remove commit and delete the changes ⚠️\n\nFor your situation, --soft is the safer choice because you don't want to lose your work.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "toJV-Z2ytdmu8HjarRWvC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 325.3994465977694,
      "y": 23163.072234024046,
      "width": 1320,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 64885403,
      "version": 1090,
      "versionNonce": 1718952736,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791256962112,
      "created": 1790318187657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Features               Open Source Models                                   Closed-Source Models\nCost                   Free to use(NO API Costs)                            Paid API usage(i.e OpenAI charges per token)\nControl                Can modify, download, deploy                         Locked to Provider's infrastructure\nData Privacy           Runs Locally                                         Send queries to provider's server\nCustomization          Can fine tune on specific DS                         No access to fine tuning\nDeployment             can be deployed on on-premise or cloud server.       Must use vendor's api",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Features               Open Source Models                                   Closed-Source Models\nCost                   Free to use(NO API Costs)                            Paid API usage(i.e OpenAI charges per token)\nControl                Can modify, download, deploy                         Locked to Provider's infrastructure\nData Privacy           Runs Locally                                         Send queries to provider's server\nCustomization          Can fine tune on specific DS                         No access to fine tuning\nDeployment             can be deployed on on-premise or cloud server.       Must use vendor's api",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "l2qQ0qo_EWnyyZmJ_oeHj",
      "type": "text",
