    {
      "id": "_ppGybyrg4tAORskNUtf0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 657.2080403477694,
      "y": 21414.306609024046,
      "width": 968.6367187500001,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1640789728,
      "version": 642,
      "versionNonce": 2001239840,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791257773523,
      "created": 1791257590410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "prompts are very important for LLM, if we do little change in prompt, LLM Output will be\nchange, so LLM output highly dependent on prompt\n\nthere are two types of prompts\n1. Textual Prompt -> here we deal with text\n2. Multimodal prompts -> here we pass image or audio with text lets say we have uploaded\nsong and ask who is the singer\n\n\ntoday we talk majorly on textual\n\nPrompts are so much important, now days we have new job profile on top of this called as\nprompt engineering.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "prompts are very important for LLM, if we do little change in prompt, LLM Output will be change, so LLM output highly dependent on prompt\n\nthere are two types of prompts\n1. Textual Prompt -> here we deal with text\n2. Multimodal prompts -> here we pass image or audio with text lets say we have uploaded song and ask who is the singer\n\n\ntoday we talk majorly on textual\n\nPrompts are so much important, now days we have new job profile on top of this called as\nprompt engineering.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7ph0zzIj5axM5-LqOrpGh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 585.4619465977694,
      "y": 21850.517546524046,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 437736224,
      "version": 32,
      "versionNonce": 956741408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791257857610,
      "created": 1791257848612,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Static Vs Dynamic Prompt ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Static Vs Dynamic Prompt ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AowW32yFHyRWWPpunTIog",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 644.8877278477694,
      "y": 21890.380827774046,
      "width": 1013.83203125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 853681952,
      "version": 418,
      "versionNonce": 1712833248,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791260435204,
      "created": 1791257892564,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "lets say we have build a research assistant tool, here we will give a box input to send\ntext, we will fetch that text and pass to LLM and then output we will show to user, this is\nthe flow.\n\nfrom langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\nimport streamlit as st\n\nload_dotenv()  # Load environment variables from .env file\n\nst.header(\"Research Tool\")\nuser_input = st.text_input(\"Enter your prompt/query here:\")\nmodel = ChatOpenAI(model = \"gpt-4\", temperature = 0.7)\n\n\nif st.button(\"Submit\"):\n    result = model.invoke(user_input)\n    st.write(result.content)\n\n\nhere we are giving static prompt as every time user need to put whole prompt",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "lets say we have build a research assistant tool, here we will give a box input to send text, we will fetch that text and pass to LLM and then output we will show to user, this is the flow.\n\nfrom langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\nimport streamlit as st\n\nload_dotenv()  # Load environment variables from .env file\n\nst.header(\"Research Tool\")\nuser_input = st.text_input(\"Enter your prompt/query here:\")\nmodel = ChatOpenAI(model = \"gpt-4\", temperature = 0.7)\n\n\nif st.button(\"Submit\"):\n    result = model.invoke(user_input)\n    st.write(result.content)\n\n\nhere we are giving static prompt as every time user need to put whole prompt",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TpoM24CSrAl2okEkZjh8x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 641.4619465977694,
      "y": 22480.517546524046,
      "width": 187,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
